    "claim": "One test, three panels, one receipt: fabius improves every model it runs on — measured blind on all four newest Claude models with the shipped files verbatim, verified objectively by executing the generated code against hidden tests and checking domain deliverables against factual checklists, and demoed blind across external model families — while cutting output on every model.",
