    "honest_misses": "Printed, not hidden: on the objective panel every one of the four models gains (+3.5 to +17.4); on the quality panel three of the four tiers gain — Sonnet 5 +0.43, Fable 5 +0.23, Opus 4.8 +0.20 — and the single miss is Haiku dipping -0.33 on trivial one-liners under a full verbatim contract (-4.50 on those three tasks) while gaining +0.71 on its specialist tasks — the empirical case for model-tier routing and the lean gate.",
